{"scope":"knowledge","page":5,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-740061d94c39","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"歌词格式示例","description":"以下是角色主题曲/OP/ED 歌词的标准格式。歌词使用段落标记 `[section]`，与 Music API 的歌词输入格式兼容。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/lyrics-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-756f0b5fc5e9","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"聚合与实体","description":"聚合只读 S2 的逐章提取，**不回头重读原文**。原文在 S2 已经被读过一次；再读一次得到的 不是补充，是第二份互相矛盾的事实。需要核对某条硬事实时回查具体那一条白描， 而不是重新通读。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze/references/aggregation-and-entities.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-761c51ffc99b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"项目定位与安全写入","description":"优先使用用户给出的项目路径；没有项目时可以直接在用户指定目录完成独立任务。需要项目配置时运行：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/runtime-preflight.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-76deb8391668","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"爽感矩阵","description":"**定义**：通过暴露隐藏的高阶身份，实现对嘲讽者/欺压者的降维打击。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-7845afd57cab","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"节奏曲线设计","description":"微短剧的节奏不是\"一直爽\"，而是\"紧→松→更紧→松→最紧\"的波形。就像过山车，持续加速反而麻木，有起有落才刺激。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-791078194c67","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"身份、版本与复用判断","description":"不要先问“要不要新建文件”，按顺序问：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/identity-vs-variant.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-7ada253eb176","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"交付档案：容器算术与槽位语义","description":"交付档案是创作者**可选**声明的一份排布约定：把已接受的运动规格摊成执行端逐行读取的 文本。本套件只规定每个槽位**必须回答什么**（语义），不规定它**写成什么样子**（语法）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/delivery-profile.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-7f7628d08f88","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"创作参考作品的安全摄取","description":"用户提供对标剧、小说、分镜样例或提示词时，学习它解决问题的机制，不召回它的表达外壳。 本流程只读取用户在当前会话明确提供或授权的材料；不自行连接外部、非公开项目库。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/creative-reference-intake.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-844145d2ddcd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"付费点设计指南","description":"付费点必须设在观众情绪最高涨的时刻，而非平淡叙事中。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/paywall-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-85f7a457edb3","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"黄金开场规则","description":"观众在前 5 秒决定是否继续观看。开场必须制造**即时冲突**或**强烈悬念**。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/opening-rules.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8a29d6a65558","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"原声蓝图格式示例","description":"以下是 `soundtrack-plan.md` 的标准格式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/soundtrack-plan-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b06289a8c21","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"付费卡点设计策略","description":"付费卡点是微短剧商业化的命脉。设计得好，观众觉得\"这钱花得值\"；设计得差，观众觉得\"被骗了\"然后弃剧。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/paywall-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b2c9aa95168","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"剧情分析格式示例","description":"以下是 `analysis.md` 的标准格式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/analysis-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d3fe8b339bb","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"连续短剧的人物、切入与跨集记忆","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 先建前史储备，再选叙事切入窗口 3. 用人物驱动力预测选择 4. 把人物变化写成可追踪的压力测试 5. 每集必须产生局部戏剧结果 6. 管理信息权限与铺垫债务 7. 用双轨节奏安排张弛 8. 建立可恢复的跨集记忆 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/serial-character-and-memory.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d543649cd31","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧对白方法","description":"1. 对白的工作定义与规则分级 2. 先写议程，再写句子 3. 台词是一种行动 4. 潜台词来自已知差与风险 5. 信息如何进入冲突 6. 人物声音如何区分 7. 让对话改变权力与关系 8. 动作、停顿、打断与沉默 9. 高密度对白场景 10. 对白修订流程 11. 合成示例 12. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/dialogue-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d8941a667fa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"场景空镜与地理保持","description":"场景空镜保持 accepted layout、orientation、fixed anchors、materials 与光向。 默认不带角色，以保持作为地理参考的复用性；只在创作者明确需要尺度参照 或剧情所有的 occupancy state 时加人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/location-plate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8f209c86c750","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"题材指南","description":"短剧的差异化竞争力来自题材叠加。规则：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/genre-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-91c833af5a7e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"爽点矩阵","description":"观众看微短剧的核心诉求就是\"爽\"。爽点设计得好，观众欲罢不能；设计得差，观众昏昏欲睡。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-93a38c68d81d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Fresh-agent Blind Forward Eval Protocol","description":"验证候选是否帮助新的 agent 在陌生题材中做出更好的创作判断，而不是验证它能否复述学习材料。 保持三类角色分离：候选作者、fresh-agent 执行者、independent reviewer。任何参与摘取、卡片合成或候选 写作的 agent 都不能担任最终 reviewer。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/blind-forward-eval.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-960216756bfa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"通用资产图片提示词配方","description":"1. 目的与输入 2. 从资产事实到画面语言 3. 八段式配方 4. 锚点、约束与取舍 5. 输出、失败征兆与检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/common-recipe.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-98548a10deed","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"分镜时间轴 Prompt 格式（剧本 → 逐镜生成指令）","description":"> 把单集剧本拆成 5–6 个定时镜头，每镜写成一条「生成就绪」的 prompt。 > 格式借鉴 Seedance2-Storyboard-Generator 的时间轴写法，适配 Easel 的 ai-image-gen / ai-video-gen。 > 落盘为 `episodes/epNN/shots.json`，写完用 `drama_ops.py shots validate` 校验。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/shot-prompt-format.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-9980ba7eec41","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"常见场面的分镜方法：竖屏、单房、证据与群体轴线","description":"先使用镜头设计资料中的原文落实、镜头目的和场景地理方法。只有遇到下列场面时才读 本文；这些是思考步骤，不是镜头数量模板。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/blocking-playbooks.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-999eab3d7f03","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"题材条件与钩子手册","description":"这份参考资料来自对不同题材完整“剧本—资产—分镜—提示词修订”链的定性阅读。 它只保留可以用在新项目里的故事推进方法和常见问题，不保留项目名、原台词、内部 ID、原提示词、媒体 地址、供应商字段或题材频次。这里没有热度排名，也没有按标签自动套用的剧情公式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/genre-and-hook-playbook.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":